{"game": "aliens-fireteam-elite", "language": "english", "appid": 1549970, "month": "2025-01", "window": 3, "start_date": 1736985600, "end_date": 1737676799, "month_true_total": 113, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-04 02:24:30 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "186248707", "author": {"steamid": "76561198368214027", "personaname": "ᙖᕬᖽᐸᗋ", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/bkabakabakabakabakabaka/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 57, "playtime_forever": 482, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 482, "last_played": 1737388409, "avatar": "9c4d8bb9b17668d064b3e3e73b7cf77a24ccba8f"}, "language": "english", "review": "Multiplayer made is VERY SUCK. SINGLE player is DEPRESSIVE.\neven though I’m a fan of aliens, I do not recommend it.\nmost WORST multiplayer decisions combo that i ever seen.\nDon't BUY", "timestamp_created": 1737665813, "timestamp_updated": 1737764739, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 5, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.547139585018157959", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "186235363", "author": {"steamid": "76561198373228282", "personaname": "TanaDarko", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198373228282/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 2054, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 954, "last_played": 1787021855, "avatar": "04f6110cf6a524587a1c385aaf8da4565449329b"}, "language": "english", "review": "Short but fun, has a real HALO feel to it. It's military, you run out of ammo. Good co-op too - only real flaw is that if somebody drops out during a mission they can't join back in, meaning if you're playing with friends everybody has to abandon the quest and start over.", "timestamp_created": 1737652695, "timestamp_updated": 1737652695, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "186231381", "author": {"steamid": "76561198121812798", "personaname": "SmexyStrawberry", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/186108/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 77, "playtime_forever": 4369, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4369, "last_played": 1735123708, "avatar": "661cd48f0350e30b840f0a9979a9f900a8de8008"}, "language": "english", "review": "This is an amazing game to play with friends, very lore friendly and really makes you feel the love for the universe.\nIt fundamentally plays like Left 4 Dead but half way through throws shooty bois at you.\nGuns feel great, character voicing definitely needs to be higher as your guns just drown it out.\nMy only complaint is that you never kill the queen. You kill a [spoiler] Pathogen Queen [/spoiler] but that isn't the same.\nSolid 8/10", "timestamp_created": 1737649322, "timestamp_updated": 1737649322, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "186224696", "author": {"steamid": "76561198029799628", "personaname": "Steinhund", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198029799628/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 8345, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2998, "last_played": 1744795787, "avatar": "b1f618dc179bd50ac233c3b46f8cf32e31b05e37"}, "language": "english", "review": "\"Game over, man! Game over!\"\r\n\r\nPhenomenally fun gameplay mixed with really granular customization when it comes to guns, attachments, and appearances. A bit reminiscent of Remnant: From the Ashes, another game I absolutely love.\r\n\r\nThe campaigns aren't long, but they contain plenty of references to the movies (great if you're a buff) and each one is surprisingly replayable. Plus, difficulty levels add more replay value and ramp up the intensity from relatively standard to... the quote above.\r\n\r\nFrom what I've heard, it doesn't have a massive online MP presence (a bit surprising, really, but I guess everyone is busy with Fortnite and Apex? >:( ), but if you've got 2-3 friends to play the 3-person co-op, it's well worth it.", "timestamp_created": 1737642942, "timestamp_updated": 1737642942, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "186220106", "author": {"steamid": "76561199144021971", "personaname": "FightFlight©", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/FightFlight88/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 60, "playtime_forever": 75, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 75, "last_played": 1737637566, "avatar": "d577cba1ab1f72d33dd7b163a32fc215e4b4be95"}, "language": "english", "review": "5/10 Mediocre.", "timestamp_created": 1737638023, "timestamp_updated": 1737638023, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.502824842929840088", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}]}